- @begin: The strike begins.

@begin
title: Three Million on Strike
new-page: true

= Three Million on Strike

The trams stand in their depots. The newspapers do not appear, except ours, printed in a cellar. In the Lustgarten the police wait beside their lorries. [? if e23_cuno_aim = 1 : Our slogan is short: away with Cuno. ?][? if e23_cuno_aim = 2 : Our slogan asks every Social Democrat a question: away with Cuno, and who governs then? ?][? if e23_cuno_aim = 3 : Our slogan is the oldest one: all power to the councils. ?]

While the presses stand still the government cannot pay its officials or its police. The strikers have a few days' food at home.
